WordMemoryCards is an independently developed, iPad-first vocabulary app. It
draws on architectural and interaction ideas from TOEFL Vocab, including
general-purpose approaches to practice flow, text-to-speech, haptics, reports,
backup, and XcodeGen project organization. Some of those ideas were adapted
while implementing this project.

